{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10355","headline":"涟上别王秀才 · 高适","name":"涟上别王秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘颻经远道，客思满穷秋。\n浩荡对长涟，君行殊未休。\n崎岖山海侧，想像无前俦。\n何意照乘珠，忽然欲暗投。\n东路方萧条，楚歌复悲愁。\n暮帆使人感，去鸟兼离忧。\n行矣当自爱，壮年莫悠悠。\n余亦从此辞，异乡难久留。\n赠言岂终极，慎勿滞沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}